  "faqQ1": "A sentence got split oddly. Can I fix it?",
  "faqA1": "Yes. On the study screen, long-press a sentence or tap the edit icon to drag its boundary, or merge/split it with the neighboring sentence.",
  "faqQ2": "What subtitle formats are supported?",
  "faqA2": "SRT, VTT, and SMI. If subtitles are attached, we use their timing directly instead of analyzing silence, which is much faster.",
  "faqQ3": "How long can a file be?",
  "faqA3": "Files under 60 minutes upload quickly. Longer files can still be analyzed, but it may take more time. If uploading fails, please try again — for very long files (3+ hours), splitting them into parts is recommended.",
  "faqQ4": "Analysis is taking a long time.",
  "faqA4": "Audio-only files without subtitles need real silence detection, which takes longer for longer files. Attaching subtitles (SRT/VTT/SMI) speeds this up a lot.",
  "faqQ5": "How do I remove ads?",
  "faqA5": "Purchase \"Remove Ads\" under My > Account to remove all banner/interstitial ads permanently — a one-time purchase.",
  "faqQ6": "I switched devices and my purchase disappeared.",
  "faqA6": "Tap \"Already purchased? Restore\" on the My > Account screen. It restores automatically if you're signed into the same store account.",
  "faqQ7": "The study reminder notification isn't showing up.",
  "faqA7": "Check that notifications are allowed for ShadowingLab in your device settings, and that the reminder is enabled with the right time under My > Notification Settings.",
  "faqQ8": "Where do I change repeat count or playback speed?",
  "faqA8": "Change the defaults under My > Learning Defaults, or adjust them on the fly from the options (⋯) menu inside the study screen.",

